EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Your account is currently at risk for charge off this month due to either 90 days of non-payment or excessive delinquency.



In an effort to prevent the charge off this month, your account will need to be set up on a formal modification.



To apply for the modification, please respond with:

Bank Statements for {!Case.Last_Month__c}

Month to date transaction history for {!Case.Current_Month__c}

What payments you can maintain daily/weekly/monthly

When do you anticipate being able to resume in full?


Once received, The credit manager and legal team will review and issue a Modification Agreement for signature.




Thank you,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}

{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}

{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}
E: {!User.Email}
